{"id":"nbe9664eaab","headline":"Indian banks","summary":"Indian banks are expected to see a slight dip in return on assets this fiscal due to lower treasury income and early provisions for a new accounting rule. Profitability will remain well above historical averages.","why":"India's banks are a core part of its equity market and credit system. Return on assets measures how efficiently banks earn profit from their assets.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/banking/finance/banking/indian-banks-profitability-to-ease-this-fiscal-on-lower-treasury-gains-ecl-provisions-crisil/articleshow/131404433.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/banking/finance/banking/indian-banks-profitability-to-ease-this-fiscal-on-lower-treasury-gains-ecl-provisions-crisil/articleshow/131404433.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-05-30T05:32:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"a0d0f402af3e336e","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-05-30T05:32:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-05-30T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-4540480.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"Glavo","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/western-city-spain-tabernas-tourism-4540480/"}}